WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.360
Worth protecting.

00:02.060 --> 00:09.273
The Hubble Space Telescope has been up here since 1990, about five hundred kilometres above the ground.

00:09.723 --> 00:16.378
Like the weather satellites, and the station with its crew, it depends on the space around it staying clear.
